-    C --> D[Madrid Stage 1 training / CV]
-    D --> E[Saved source model or representation]
-    E --> F[Amsterdam adaptation using support labels]
-    F --> G[Predict Amsterdam query pixels]
-    G --> H[Macro F1, std, confusion proportions]
-```
